enya wee ndũngĩringĩka nĩ riũa,","poem":1},{"text":"kana ũringĩke nĩ mweri ũtukũ.","poem":2}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"Jehova nĩarĩkũgitagĩra kuuma ũũru-inĩ wothe:","poem":1},{"text":"nĩarĩĩmenyagĩrĩra muoyo waku;","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"Jehova nĩarĩkũmenyagĩrĩra ũkiumagara na ũgĩcooka,","poem":1},{"text":"kuuma rĩu nginya tene na tene.","poem":2}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/kik_bib/PSA/121.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/kik_bib/PSA/122.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/kik_bib/PSA/120.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":8}